{"unit_id":"Hnqhj__dsh-library#card-zh","repo":"Hnqhj/dsh-library","commit":"00b3c28401f813af22c1191e700b4c25cdbece51","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-library 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的本地产出资料库。它通过主页面侧栏入口和宿主 HTTP 路由接入 DSH，把对话与项目生成的文档、表格、图片、音视频及其他文件收进配置的本地目录。用户可以浏览目录、按名称和标注检索、筛选、预览 Markdown、代码、Word 与 Excel 文件，也可导入、上传、新建和标注资料。适合希望跨会话归档并复用项目产出的 DSH 用户；运行需要 Node.js 22 及以上版本，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:44","client.js:2636","lib/routes.js:440","lib/office.js:292","package.json:19"]}
{"unit_id":"Hnqhj__dsh-library#card-en","repo":"Hnqhj/dsh-library","commit":"00b3c28401f813af22c1191e700b4c25cdbece51","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-library adds a local deliverables library to DSH Web. Its sidebar page lets users browse, search, filter, and annotate files, preview Markdown, code, Word, and Excel documents, and import, upload, or create items in a configured local folder. It requires Node.js 22 or later and no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:44","client.js:2636","lib/routes.js:440","lib/office.js:292","package.json:19"]}
